<title>BELGIUM: No tax precondition for EMU, de Silguy says.</title>
<headline>No tax precondition for EMU, de Silguy says.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Economic Affairs Commissioner Yves Thibault de Silguy said on Friday that tax or social harmonisation was not a requirement for economic and monetary union.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no tax or social precondition attached to EMU,&quot; he told a briefing with Swedish journalists ahead of a visit on Friday to Stockholm.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 287 68 11</p>
